@page
@model IndexModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home page";
}
<section class="flex justify-between items-center bg-Neutral-Silver py-16 ">
    <div class="grid max-w-screen-xl px-4 mx-auto lg:gap-8 xl:gap-0  lg:grid-cols-12">
        <div class="mr-auto place-self-center lg:col-span-7">
            <h1 class="max-w-2xl mb-4 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-none md:text-5xl xl:text-6xl dark:text-white">Verify Your Favourite e-commerce site</h1>
            <p class="max-w-2xl mb-6 font-light text-gray-500 lg:mb-8 md:text-lg lg:text-xl dark:text-gray-400">This helps businesses build credibility by displaying a verified trust seal on approved websites,which enhances customer confidence.</p>
            <a href="@Url.Page("/Account/Register", new { area = "Identity" })" class="mt-2 sm:mt-0 block px-3 md:px-5 py-2 md:py-3 text-xs sm:text-lg font-bold text-center inline-flex items-center text-white bg-blue-700 rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-800 focus:ring-4 focus:outline-none focus:ring-blue-300 dark:bg-blue-600 dark:hover:bg-blue-700 dark:focus:ring-blue-800">Getting Started</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hidden lg:mt-0 lg:col-span-5 lg:flex">
            <img src="~/assets/Illustration.png" alt="mockup">
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 flex" id="ourservices">
    <div class="py-8 px-4 mx-auto max-w-screen-xl sm:py-16 lg:px-6">
        <div class="max-w-sm mx-auto mb-8 lg:mb-16">
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-4xl tracking-tight font-extrabold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Our Services</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-500 sm:text-xl  dark:text-gray-400"> Who is Trust Seal Suitable For?</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-8 md:grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 md:gap-12 md:space-y-0">
            <div class="block max-w-sm p-6 flex border border-gray-200 rounded-lg shadow-xl flex-col items-center justify-center text-center">
                <div>
                   
                    <img class="w-20 h-20" src="~/assets/Icon.svg" />
                </div>
                <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold dark:text-white">Personal</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">For a personal business, a trust seal offers a vital layer of credibility that can help overcome initial skepticism from potential customers. It signals that the business has met certain standards of trustworthiness, whether related to security, service quality, or ethical practices.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="block max-w-sm p-6 flex border border-gray-200 rounded-lg shadow-xl flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center">
                <div>

                    <img class="w-20 h-20" src="~/assets/Icon2.svg" />
                </div>
                <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold dark:text-white">Businesses</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">For a small or medium-sized enterprise (SME), a trust seal can be a powerful tool to build credibility and compete with larger brands. It reassures potential customers that the business is legitimate, secure, and committed to quality standards—factors that are especially important when trust is still being established.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="block max-w-sm p-6 flex border border-gray-200 rounded-lg shadow-xl flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center">
                <div>

                    <img class="w-20 h-20" src="~/assets/Icon1.svg" />
                </div>
                <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold dark:text-white">Enterprise</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">A trust seal provides significant value to an enterprise by enhancing brand credibility and building customer confidence. It serves as third-party validation that the business meets recognized standards for security, reliability, or ethical practices.</p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="flex justify-between items-center bg-Neutral-Silver  py-16" id="about">
        <div class=" mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
                        Helping a local business reinvent itself
                    </h1>
                    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-8">
                        We offer a trust seal certification software solution designed to seamlessly integrate with our partners' existing systems and e-commerce platforms. This solution enables imprinting of trust seals onto approved websites and equips partners with the necessary tools and resources to implement and manage the certification process for successful applicants.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-end">
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                        <img class="w-20 h-20" src="~/assets/Icon1.svg" />
                            <span class="text-gray-700 font-medium">2,245,341</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                        <img class="w-20 h-20" src="~/assets/Icon1.svg" />
                            <span class="text-gray-700 font-medium">46,328</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
</section>


